<exercises xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="s_posets_PI" component="runestone-PI">
  <title>Pertanyaan Instruksi Sejawat</title>
  <exercise label="posets_PI_movie-poset">
    <statement correct="yes">
      <p>Saya memahami cara Bob menyusun gambarnya dalam tugas persiapan kelas.
      </p>
      <image width="65%" source="movies">
        <description>Diagram Hasse peringkat Bob atas tujuh film: Saving Private Ryan, Life is Beautiful, Forrest Gump, Braveheart, Good Will Hunting, Titanic, dan Jurassic Park. Sepuluh relasi penutupnya, dengan film pertama di bawah film kedua, adalah Braveheart–Saving Private Ryan, Braveheart–Life is Beautiful, Jurassic Park–Braveheart, Titanic–Good Will Hunting, Forrest Gump–Saving Private Ryan, Good Will Hunting–Saving Private Ryan, Good Will Hunting–Life is Beautiful, Jurassic Park–Forrest Gump, Jurassic Park–Titanic, dan Forrest Gump–Life is Beautiful.</description>
      </image>
    </statement>
  </exercise>
  <exercise label="posets_PI_antichains">
    <statement>
      <p>Manakah di antara himpunan-himpunan berikut yang merupakan antirantai?
      </p>
      <image width="50%">
        <description>
          <p>
            Diagram urutan 35 titik berlabel 1 sampai 35. Pasangan penutupnya, dengan titik pertama di bawah titik kedua, adalah 2–1, 25–1, 14–2, 22–2, 23–2, 3–25, 4–19, 31–4, 4–26, 4–13, 25–5, 6–27, 6–31, 35–6, 7–8, 13–7, 14–9, 9–33, 25–10, 11–30, 12–17, 12–29, 34–13, 19–15, 15–28, 16–17, 21–16, 27–16, 18–21, 27–19, 31–20, 22–25, 26–24, 24–29, 24–32, dan 27–30.
          </p>
        </description>
        <prefigure xmlns="https://prefigure.org" label="big-poset-PI1">
          <xi:include href="prefig/big-poset.xml"/>
        </prefigure>
      </image>
    </statement>
    <choices multiple-correct="yes">
      <choice correct="yes">
        <statement>
          <p><m>\{20,7,32,15\}</m></p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice>
        <statement>
          <p><m>\{9,7,32,6\}</m></p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice>
        <statement>
          <p><m>\{19,27,6,35\}</m></p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice correct="yes">
        <statement>
          <p><m>\{9,25,26,7,12\}</m></p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
    </choices>
  </exercise>  
  <exercise label="posets_PI_chains">
    <statement>
      <p>Manakah di antara himpunan-himpunan berikut yang merupakan rantai?
      </p>
      <image width="50%">
        <description>
          <p>
            Diagram urutan 35 titik berlabel 1 sampai 35. Pasangan penutupnya, dengan titik pertama di bawah titik kedua, adalah 2–1, 25–1, 14–2, 22–2, 23–2, 3–25, 4–19, 31–4, 4–26, 4–13, 25–5, 6–27, 6–31, 35–6, 7–8, 13–7, 14–9, 9–33, 25–10, 11–30, 12–17, 12–29, 34–13, 19–15, 15–28, 16–17, 21–16, 27–16, 18–21, 27–19, 31–20, 22–25, 26–24, 24–29, 24–32, dan 27–30.
          </p>
        </description>
        <prefigure xmlns="https://prefigure.org" label="big-poset-PI2">
          <xi:include href="prefig/big-poset.xml"/>
        </prefigure>
      </image>
    </statement>
    <choices multiple-correct="yes">
      <choice correct="yes">
        <statement>
          <p><m>\{8,4,35\}</m></p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice>
        <statement>
          <p><m>\{8,4,31,2,22\}</m></p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice correct="yes">
        <statement>
          <p><m>\{19,27,6,35\}</m></p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice correct="yes">
        <statement>
          <p><m>\{29,24,26,4,31,6,35\}</m></p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
    </choices>
  </exercise>  
  <exercise label="posets_PI_antichain-type">
    <statement>
      <p>Himpunan <m>\{12,13,30,16\}</m> merupakan
      </p>
      <image width="50%">
        <description>
          <p>
            Diagram urutan 35 titik berlabel 1 sampai 35. Pasangan penutupnya, dengan titik pertama di bawah titik kedua, adalah 2–1, 25–1, 14–2, 22–2, 23–2, 3–25, 4–19, 31–4, 4–26, 4–13, 25–5, 6–27, 6–31, 35–6, 7–8, 13–7, 14–9, 9–33, 25–10, 11–30, 12–17, 12–29, 34–13, 19–15, 15–28, 16–17, 21–16, 27–16, 18–21, 27–19, 31–20, 22–25, 26–24, 24–29, 24–32, dan 27–30.
          </p>
        </description>
        <prefigure xmlns="https://prefigure.org" label="big-poset-PI3">
          <xi:include href="prefig/big-poset.xml"/>
        </prefigure>
      </image>
    </statement>
    <choices>
      <choice>
        <statement>
          <p>antirantai maksimal (tetapi bukan terbesar).</p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice>
        <statement>
          <p>antirantai terbesar.</p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice correct="yes">
        <statement>
          <p>antirantai, tetapi bukan maksimal maupun terbesar.</p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
      <choice>
        <statement>
          <p>bukan antirantai.</p>
        </statement>
      </choice>
    </choices>
  </exercise>  
  <exercise label="posets_PI_chain-type1">
    <statement>
      <p>Himpunan <m>\{3,25,10\}</m> merupakan
      </p>
      <image width="50%">
        <description>
          <p>
            Diagram urutan 35 titik berlabel 1 sampai 35. Pasangan penutupnya, dengan titik pertama di bawah titik kedua, adalah 2–1, 25–1, 14–2, 22–2, 23–2, 3–25, 4–19, 31–4, 4–26, 4–13, 25–5, 6–27, 6–31, 35–6, 7–8, 13–7, 14–9, 9–33, 25–10, 11–30, 12–17, 12–29, 34–13, 19–15, 15–28, 16–17, 21–16, 27–16, 18–21, 27–19, 31–20, 22–25, 26–24, 24–29, 24–32, dan 27–30.
