  <exercise label="posets_PI_chain-type2">
    <statement>
      <p>Himpunan <m>\{8,7,13,4,31,6,35\}</m> merupakan
      </p>
      <image width="50%">
        <description>
          <p>
            Diagram urutan 35 titik berlabel 1 sampai 35. Pasangan penutupnya, dengan titik pertama di bawah titik kedua, adalah 2–1, 25–1, 14–2, 22–2, 23–2, 3–25, 4–19, 31–4, 4–26, 4–13, 25–5, 6–27, 6–31, 35–6, 7–8, 13–7, 14–9, 9–33, 25–10, 11–30, 12–17, 12–29, 34–13, 19–15, 15–28, 16–17, 21–16, 27–16, 18–21, 27–19, 31–20, 22–25, 26–24, 24–29, 24–32, dan 27–30.
